    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Bucketlist Tourist</strong> is a thrilling multiplayer party game that takes photographic challenges to a new level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/89c6252927593a23d3939f117feab1fc.poster.avif?t=1753112932\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/89c6252927593a23d3939f117feab1fc.webm?t=1753112932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/89c6252927593a23d3939f117feab1fc.mp4?t=1753112932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In this exciting game, players compete for the best ratings on their photos. Each participant has their own remote shutter and a limited number of shots to showcase their best work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/16f633ca1ddf144ccd66cfeea02bdae6.poster.avif?t=1753112932\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/16f633ca1ddf144ccd66cfeea02bdae6.webm?t=1753112932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/16f633ca1ddf144ccd66cfeea02bdae6.mp4?t=1753112932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Inspired by Europe's famous tourist attractions, the Bucketlist challenges lead players to vibrant, colorful locations. Together, they explore these places and take on various tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/d32b274556746c8c800b6a6286a9685e.poster.avif?t=1753112932\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/d32b274556746c8c800b6a6286a9685e.webm?t=1753112932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/d32b274556746c8c800b6a6286a9685e.mp4?t=1753112932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>At the end of each round, the photos are evaluated based on specific criteria, with the player who has the most creative and compelling snapshots emerging as the winner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play with friends and family on the couch and enjoy a shared gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Challenge your friends by taking the best photos at stunning travel destinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a variety of unique and picturesque locations around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience a vibrant, colorful environment that is both challenging and entertaining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Complete the tourist's bucket list by accomplishing a range of exciting and fun tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Simple controls and intuitive mechanics that appeal to players of all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Earn in-game currency through a high picture score to unlock new items, outfits, and accessories in the shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play in competitive mode against your friends or work together to overcome challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Personalize your tourist with different outfits and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Look forward to regular content and updates to keep the game fresh and exciting.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Bucketlist Tourist</strong> is a thrilling multiplayer party game that takes photographic challenges to a new level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/89c6252927593a23d3939f117feab1fc.poster.avif?t=1753112932\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/89c6252927593a23d3939f117feab1fc.webm?t=1753112932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/89c6252927593a23d3939f117feab1fc.mp4?t=1753112932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In this exciting game, players compete for the best ratings on their photos. Each participant has their own remote shutter and a limited number of shots to showcase their best work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/16f633ca1ddf144ccd66cfeea02bdae6.poster.avif?t=1753112932\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/16f633ca1ddf144ccd66cfeea02bdae6.webm?t=1753112932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/16f633ca1ddf144ccd66cfeea02bdae6.mp4?t=1753112932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Inspired by Europe's famous tourist attractions, the Bucketlist challenges lead players to vibrant, colorful locations. Together, they explore these places and take on various tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/d32b274556746c8c800b6a6286a9685e.poster.avif?t=1753112932\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/d32b274556746c8c800b6a6286a9685e.webm?t=1753112932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/d32b274556746c8c800b6a6286a9685e.mp4?t=1753112932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>At the end of each round, the photos are evaluated based on specific criteria, with the player who has the most creative and compelling snapshots emerging as the winner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play with friends and family on the couch and enjoy a shared gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Challenge your friends by taking the best photos at stunning travel destinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a variety of unique and picturesque locations around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience a vibrant, colorful environment that is both challenging and entertaining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Complete the tourist's bucket list by accomplishing a range of exciting and fun tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Simple controls and intuitive mechanics that appeal to players of all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Earn in-game currency through a high picture score to unlock new items, outfits, and accessories in the shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play in competitive mode against your friends or work together to overcome challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Personalize your tourist with different outfits and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Look forward to regular content and updates to keep the game fresh and exciting.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "The Bucketlist Tourist is a physics-based multiplayer party game where players complete tasks and capture them photographically. In the battle for the best snapshot, they share only a single camera.",
